The '''Great Hall''', located in the [[Naboo]] [[capital]] of [[Theed]], was an annex of the [[city]]'s main [[Theed Hangar|hangar complex]]. The [[Monarch of Naboo|monarch]] of Naboo could inspect their troop during ceremonial parades held in the hall, which featured high ceilings and tall windows.<ref name="CL" />

